  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK investment in the Global Fund 2020-2022 to reduce transmission and mortality for HIV AIDS, tuberculosis and malaria through treatments, diagnostics and preventive technologies and related services</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To tackle the immediate impact of the three most deadly infectious diseases - HIV AIDS, tuberculosis and malaria - and put the international community on the right track to end the three diseases as epidemics by 2030, and achieve universal health coverage.</narrative>
  </description>
